---
// What it costs, and where the code is.
---

<section
  class="wrap section twin"
  id="price"
  aria-label="Price and source code"
>
  <div>
    <h2>About $5 a month, however big your team gets</h2>
    <p>
      OpenWorkspace runs on Cloudflare’s Workers Paid plan, which costs $5 a
      month and includes a monthly allowance for each service. If you go past
      it, Cloudflare bills the extra at its usual rates. There’s no charge per
      person.
      <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/pricing/"
        >See Cloudflare’s pricing</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Open source, with more apps on the way</h2>
    <p>
      The code is on GitHub under the Apache 2.0 license. Mail is available now,
      Git is coming soon, and you can write your own modules.
      <a href="https://github.com/iivankin/openworkspace">View the code</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
